=== QP005 profile: uqf | a multiplication with an addition to its right: q adds first
r:2*3+4
mid:0.5*bid+ask

=== clean profile: uqf | an addition with a multiplication to its right is no trap: both readings multiply first (#847)
stamp:start+step*til n
ts:t0+0D00:00:01*til n
r:a-b%c

=== QP007 profile: every | and that is the mix the rule in no profile reports
stamp:start+step*til n

=== QP005 profile: every | the trap is QP005's alone
mid:0.5*bid+ask

